class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> units up. </li></ol></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 1:24 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:12</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
